{"title":"Career roadmap · Art Teacher","role":"Art Teacher","summary":"An Art Teacher teaches drawing, painting, design, visual expression, art appreciation and creative techniques to students in schools, colleges, studios or community-learning environments. A BA Fine Arts provides the artistic foundation, but formal school-teaching positions may require a recognised teacher-education qualification and compliance with the applicable recruitment rules.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1","Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Fine Arts"},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"Strong alignment, with a teaching-qualification caveat. The BA builds subject expertise. For many formal school-teaching positions in India, the exact qualification depends on the school, board, state rules and recruitment notification; a B.Ed./relevant teacher-training route may be required or preferred."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Typical route","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["BA Fine Arts","Art Education Internship/Teaching Practice","Art Instructor/Teaching Assistant","Art Teacher","Senior Art Teacher","Art Department Coordinator","Head of Art/Visual Arts Programme"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career objective"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build strong artistic technique, art history, pedagogy and classroom skills."}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Gain formal teaching experience and specialise in school, studio, digital or therapeutic/community art education."}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress toward Senior Art Teacher, Art Coordinator or Visual Arts Curriculum Designer."}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead visual-arts programmes, teacher training, art education institutions or an independent art academy."}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn fro